"""Grade 8 Economics — foundation toward IGCSE Economics 0455.

This is an introductory Year 8 course organised by the official IGCSE (0455)
topic structure (Units 1–6). It is a foundation, not a full IGCSE course:
definitions, simple diagrams and first applications are included; later
extensions such as detailed elasticity calculations, full cost curves, or
complete balance-of-payments accounting are left for IGCSE itself.
"""
