    X("economics-1-2", type="short", id="q-ec-1-pr08", stem_zh="为什么口袋里的现金通常不直接等于资本品？", stem_en="Why is cash in a pocket not usually the same thing as a capital good?", answer="现金不直接生产货物，只是购买手段", accepted=["现金不直接生产货物，只是购买手段", "它不是机器或厂房", "cash does not produce goods directly; it is a means of buying them", "it is not a machine or a building"], answer_zh="现金通常不直接生产货物，只是购买资本或其他要素的手段。", answer_en="Cash does not usually produce goods directly; it is a means of buying capital or other factors.", exp_zh="不要把金钱与烤箱混为一谈。", exp_en="Money should not be mixed up with an oven."),
